WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.470
YouTube ads

00:00:01.506 --> 00:00:02.484
punished by the

00:00:02.296 --> 00:00:03.321
reload button

00:00:03.846 --> 00:00:05.296
YouTube Ad Punisher

00:00:05.108 --> 00:00:05.945
is a browser

00:00:05.756 --> 00:00:07.277
extension that reloads

00:00:07.089 --> 00:00:07.820
the page the

00:00:07.631 --> 00:00:08.598
moment an ad

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:09.117
appears

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.438
capturing your exact

00:00:10.249 --> 00:00:11.404
playback timestamp

00:00:11.216 --> 00:00:11.888
first

00:00:12.406 --> 00:00:13.490
After one or

00:00:13.302 --> 00:00:14.339
two reloads the

00:00:14.151 --> 00:00:15.177
ad slot is

00:00:14.989 --> 00:00:16.049
usually empty

00:00:16.203 --> 00:00:16.981
so the video

00:00:16.793 --> 00:00:17.665
plays clean

00:00:17.724 --> 00:00:18.927
with no waiting

00:00:18.727 --> 00:00:19.658
and no skip

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:20.460
button hunting

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:22.216
If three reloads

00:00:22.028 --> 00:00:22.617
fail

00:00:22.771 --> 00:00:23.690
it switches to

00:00:23.502 --> 00:00:24.456
a helper tab

00:00:24.268 --> 00:00:25.447
for four seconds

00:00:25.613 --> 00:00:26.862
then switches back

00:00:26.898 --> 00:00:27.475
and the ad

00:00:27.287 --> 00:00:28.006
is gone

00:00:28.542 --> 00:00:29.556
Full story on

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:30.263
the dashboard
